OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being struck
OL,4,Aby lorry in Scottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a lorry in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the A72, a
OL,11,Fquarter of a mile north of the village
OL,12,Fof Skirling, at about 12: 50 on Monday.
OL,14,FA 59-year-old man, was pronounced dead
OL,15,Fat the scene. His family has been
OL,16,Finformed.
OL,18,FThe A72 was closed for several hours
OL,19,Ffollowing the crash but reopened at
OL,20,Fabout 19:30.  There were no other
OL,21,Freported injuries, and inquiries are
OL,22,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
